            "eyebrow": "WHO WE ARE",
            "heading": "A Shopify Agency Built for Growth",
            "body": "RootSyntax was founded with a simple mission — help ecommerce brands unlock their full potential on Shopify. We combine strategic thinking, modern design, and powerful development to deliver experiences that convert and scale. From startups to established brands, we’re the team behind stores that perform.",
